From eecefc477c3944e3d7a612917ea3995317c15f1e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TripleU <182648541+TripleU613@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 16:17:01 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] J714s developer image: kernel pkgrel 2 (NVMe compatible for
 U-Boot), gcc-built U-Boot

linux-aurora 7.3.0.aurora16.j714s3-2 adds linux-aurora-n1 0009 (the t6050
NVMe compatible U-Boot needs) and uboot-aurora 2026.07.aurora6.j714s3-1 is
the same U-Boot built natively: the x86-cross j714s2 build declared a
512 KiB arm64 image_size for a 752 KB image and m1n1 refused to load it.
Both from betizzel/omarchy-m5 installer/recipes.
